- Most days. Thank you.
- I think so too.

@rule react.h.f_small_future_nurse_state.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_future_nurse_state fit=bad
feel pout
- I asked about you.
- Don't change the subject.

@rule me.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state
on me.small
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state
- What does a nurse do on her day off?
- Any plans for the weekend?

@rule move.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state
- Ask how she switches off

@rule react.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A book where nobody gets hurt.
- A murder mystery. I like to check the injuries.

@rule move.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.share
on move.share
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state
- Say a long walk sounds good to you too

@rule react.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.share
on react
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state move=share fit=good|neutral
- It's the best medicine. No prescription.
- Then do it. Doctor's orders.

@rule move.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state
- Ask if she takes her own temperature on Sundays

@rule react.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Every hour. Kidding. Twice.
- I'm off duty. Mostly.

@rule react.h.f_small_weekend_nurse_state.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_weekend_nurse_state fit=bad
feel pout
- I'm nobody's nurse on Sunday.
- That's my day off you're talking about.

@rule me.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state
on me.small
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state
- Do you get to eat lunch in here?
- What should I be having for lunch?

@rule move.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state
- Ask what she has for lunch at her desk

@rule react.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something green. I have to set an example.
- A sandwich, and half a cold coffee.

@rule move.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.invite
on move.invite
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state
- Offer to eat with her so she gets a break

@rule react.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.invite
on react
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Someone would come in. But thank you.
- Sit down, then. Don't touch the cold packs.

@rule move.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state
- Hide your bag of chips

@rule react.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I saw that. It's going in your file.
- You can't hide that from me.

@rule react.h.f_small_lunch_nurse_state.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_lunch_nurse_state fit=bad
feel pout
- Eat something green, please.
- Don't sit there, it's for patients.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine
- Ask what a nurse does on a quiet day

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Inventory. Then I count the inventory again.
- I read health records. Very dull. Mostly.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine
- Say you came to see her, not the beds

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.tease
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Flattery gets you a free check-up.
- Careful. I take pulses. I'd notice.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.share
on move.share
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine
- Say you're glad nobody's hurt

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.share
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine move=share fit=good|neutral
- So am I. Don't tell my boss.
- Sweet. Stay that way.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_fine.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_fine fit=bad
feel pout
- Then go and be healthy somewhere else.
- Hm. Not your best line.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_up.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up
- Ask what put her in a good mood

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_up.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Guess. No, not you. Well, maybe a little.
- Nobody bled on anything today.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_up.praise
on move.praise
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up
- Say the smile suits her

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_up.praise
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up move=praise fit=good|neutral
- I know. But go on.
- You're learning. Keep going.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_up.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up
- Say you'll catch her like this more often

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_up.tease
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You'd need an appointment.
- Only if you bring the coffee.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_up.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_up fit=bad
feel pout
- And there goes my mood.
- You had one chance.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low
- Tell her to lie down for ten minutes

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_low.comfort
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Stealing my line? I'm impressed.
- Ten minutes. Watch the door for me.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low
- Ask what kept her on her feet

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_low.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- One sprain, two faints, and a very long form.
- A student who thought it was the flu. It was love.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_low.share
on move.share
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low
- Offer to get her a coffee

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_low.share
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low move=share fit=good|neutral
- You're a good boy. Black, please.
- Now that's the right medicine.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_low.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_low fit=bad
feel pout
- Not today.
- Find someone else to bother.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_close.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close
- Say you came for your check-up

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_close.tease
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Then close your eyes and hold still.
- Your heart rate says I'm doing fine.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_close.share
on move.share
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close
- Tell her you've been looking forward to this

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_close.share
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close move=share fit=good|neutral
- So have I. Don't let it go to your head.
- Good. That's the right answer.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_lina_close.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close
- Ask how her day's really been

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_close.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Better, now.
- Long, until you walked in.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_lina_close.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_lina_close fit=bad
feel pout
- You've picked a bad moment, sweetheart.
- Hm. Try again later.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_school.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school
- Ask what's the best secret she's heard

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_school.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A nurse never tells. Ask me again over dinner.
- Someone in this building cries in the supply closet. Weekly.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_school.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school
- Say you'll tell her everything too, then

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_school.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'll get a longer chart.
- You already do. You just don't notice.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_school.share
on move.share
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school
- Say it must be heavy, knowing all that

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_school.share
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school move=share fit=good|neutral
- Sometimes. That's sweet of you.
- It's why I smile so much. It keeps them talking.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_school.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_school fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't repeat that.
- Forget I said it.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend
- Ask what she does with a free weekend

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Dinner somewhere with tablecloths and no students.
- That's for me to know.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend
- Say you'd like to see her out of uniform

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend move=tease fit=good|neutral
- In a nice dress, you mean? Behave.
- You'd have to be a much better boy.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.share
on move.share
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend
- Say she's earned the rest

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.share
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend move=share fit=good|neutral
- I have, haven't I?
- Finally, someone who understands.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_weekend.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_weekend fit=bad
feel pout
- None of your business, patient.
- Mind your own Saturday.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch
- Say you'll report her chocolate bar

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch move=tease fit=good|neutral
- To whom? I'm the authority here.
- I'll prescribe you silence.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.invite
on move.invite
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch
- Offer to bring her a real lunch

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.invite
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd feed me? How romantic.
- I'll take the fish, then.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch
- Ask what she'd really like to eat

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something I don't eat standing up.
- Sushi. With a chair.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_lunch.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_lunch fit=bad
feel pout
- Then keep your vegetables to yourself.
- I don't need a lecture from a patient.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_future.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future
- Ask why she stays here

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_future.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future move=ask fit=good|neutral
