- Students heal fast and they say thank you.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_future.praise
on move.praise
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future
- Say the campus would be worse without her

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_future.praise
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It would be a lot bloodier.
- Say that to the dean, please.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_lina_future.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future
- Say you'd follow her to that sea view

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_future.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'd make you carry the bags.
- Careful, I might hold you to that.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_lina_future.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_lina_future fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't worry about my plans.
- That's far too personal a question.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine
- Ask what the third goal is

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Finish this sentence, and go.
- To teach one person something today. You'll do.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.praise
on move.praise
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine
- Say she's more organized than the whole department

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.praise
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine move=praise fit=good|neutral
- That's a low bar. But yes.
- I'm aware. Thank you.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.share
on move.share
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine
- Say you've set a goal too

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.share
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine move=share fit=good|neutral
- Write it down. Then we'll talk.
- Good. How will you measure it?

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_fine.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_fine fit=bad
feel pout
- You're wasting your three minutes.
- Come back when you've got a point.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_up.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up
- Ask which journal

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_up.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A good one. I'll send you the reference.
- You won't have heard of it. You should have.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_up.praise
on move.praise
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up
- Congratulate her

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_up.praise
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. It took two years.
- I'll accept that. Just this once.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_up.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up
- Say she's almost smiling

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_up.tease
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I don't know what you mean.
- It's a muscle. I exercise it quarterly.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_up.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_up fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't spoil it.
- Is that all?

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low
- Say one bad day won't ruin the plan

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_low.comfort
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You're right. I'd have told you the same.
- Hm. It's a rounding error, then.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low
- Ask what threw the schedule off

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_low.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- People. It's always people.
- The dean moved a meeting. Without asking.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_low.share
on move.share
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low
- Offer to help with something on her list

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_low.share
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low move=share fit=good|neutral
- You'd do that? Fine. Page four.
- I'll give you the easy part.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_low.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_low fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't need sympathy. I need four more hours.
- Don't manage me.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_close.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close
- Ask what "personal development" involves

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_close.tease
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close move=tease fit=good|neutral
- We'll be reviewing your progress.
- You'll have to attend to find out.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_close.share
on move.share
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close
- Tell her you look forward to those ten minutes

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_close.share
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then I'll make it twelve.
- So do I. Don't tell anyone.

@rule move.h.f_day_t_reina_close.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close
- Ask when she last took a real break

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_close.ask
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You'd have to check the calendar.
- Now. This is it.

@rule react.h.f_day_t_reina_close.bad
on react
when hook=f_day_t_reina_close fit=bad
feel pout
- Not now. I've got a deadline.
- We'll reschedule.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_school.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school
- Ask what the proposal says

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_school.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Fewer electives. More proofs.
- Read it. It's in the library. I put it there.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_school.agree
on move.agree
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school
- Say you could be doing better yourself

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_school.agree
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Good. Admitting it is step one.
- I know. That's why I'm telling you.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_school.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school
- Ask if the dean has run away yet

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_school.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school move=tease fit=good|neutral
- He's moved his office hours.
- I know where he parks.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_school.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_school fit=bad
feel pout
- That attitude is the problem.
- Then stay average.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend
- Ask what's on the plan for this Saturday

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Run, seminar, review. In that order.
- You're asking for the short version?

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend
- Ask if fun has a slot on the plan

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Between seven and seven-twenty.
- I'll consider adding one.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.share
on move.share
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend
- Say you'd only sleep all weekend

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.share
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then you'll wake up exactly where you are.
- Sleep is fine. Eight hours, not fourteen.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_weekend.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_weekend fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't call it wasted if you've never tried it.
- My Saturdays aren't a joke.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch
- Ask why she doesn't use the cafeteria

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The line. It needs arrows and a second till. It's not difficult.
- The line. I've drawn them a diagram. It's laminated.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.tease
on move.tease
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch
- Say even the salad must be bored by now

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.tease
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch move=tease fit=good|neutral
- The salad does as it's told.
- You've eaten worse, and slower.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.invite
on move.invite
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch
- Ask if she'd like company for those twelve minutes

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.invite
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You may sit. Eat quickly.
- Thirteen, if you've got something to say.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_lunch.bad
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_lunch fit=bad
feel pout
- How I eat is not a topic.
- Don't you have somewhere to be?

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_future.ask
on move.ask
when hook=f_small_t_reina_future
- Ask how she'll get there

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_future.ask
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_future move=ask fit=good|neutral
- One year at a time, in writing.
- By being better prepared than everyone in the room.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_future.share
on move.share
when hook=f_small_t_reina_future
- Say you don't have a plan yet

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_future.share
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_future move=share fit=good|neutral
