- Honest, at least. Start tonight.

@rule move.h.f_small_t_reina_future.praise
on move.praise
when hook=f_small_t_reina_future
- Say you'd bet on her

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_future.praise
on react
when hook=f_small_t_reina_future move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Good. You'd win.
- Sensible of you.

@rule react.h.f_small_t_reina_future.bad
